  "details": "Physbones, Contacts, triggers and other avatar components to be allowed on worlds to allow for further connectivity and interaction to worlds\n\nthe reason I'm requesting this is for worlds is that myself and many others wish to see more things to be able be done on worlds such as but not limited to\n\nmore detailed NPCs that can interact with your avatars if compatible worldside\n\navatar trigger based functions, for example a keycard or if a certain trigger on an avatar goes off it could interact with the world and cause a sync world event\n\nthere is many possibilities to be able to done with this",
